{"id": "DRZwqTXEZQ-", "title": "Video by christian_villar", "description": "Que es mejor, ser empleado o emprendedor…\n\nPues ninguna de las dos, porque en ambas sigues cambiando tiempo por dinero.\n\nCuando lo que tienes que hacer es que tu dinero trabaje por ti.\n\nY la única forma de hacerlo es invirtiendo.\n\nSi quieres aprender a invertir de forma fácil y sencilla, sígueme.\n\nRecuerda, Whatever It Takes.", "channel": "christian_villar", "uploader_id": "39595026", "uploader": "Christian Villar", "timestamp": 1763908557, "like_count": 23443, "comment_count": 355, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2071583846988702a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.327, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQNcZvAgS5IgRFq6HK2B-IYIvZCLyAUEnuntpJSTUNx9sg1qQkxhbbzO3B5vEdGpQWV_g9_pXIVXZ1sWBgxD90jX.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=IUvsFf2fBCUQ7kNvwGKnZ26&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=hq0WR0lTq3eoPMCX45SFTw&_nc_ss=7ba8c&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQMC-B0o1R4EW8kpCgUOF_DMzgVPKqmu8zL-tOlEbWHAQA&oe=6AC9D407", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 65.327, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "format": "da